titles = PackedStringArray("AWAKENING", "THE RIDDLE", "THE LOCKED WAYS", "THE LIGHT")
bodies = PackedStringArray("You wake in the dark.\n\nA small white light. Two black eyes. No memory of how you came here.\n\nMove with W A S D or the arrow keys. Walk up to anything that glows and press E.", "Every chamber is a locked thought.\n\nEach one hides a riddle - in words, in numbers, in the things that do not belong.\n\nNothing here is decoration. Read everything twice.", "A door will not open for strength.\n\nIt opens only for the right words.\n\nStand beside a door, press E, and speak the password you have earned. If you are wrong, the stone stays silent.", "The light you carry is the last one left.\n\nIt shows you what is near. It does not show you what is true.\n\nWhen a riddle turns cruel, remember - the answer was always in the room.")

